// Shosa's dance (samples\dance.shosa: three dancers, song.lys's Verse and Chorus) in three shots.
// The two .shosa and .lys files are copies of Shosa's samples.
title "Dance in three shots"
dance "dance.shosa"                     // the dancers, their movement and the song (music "song.lys")

shot 1 wide   eye   bars 1-4   look alice bob carol
shot 2 medium low   bars 5-6   look alice
shot 3 close        bars 7-8   look alice.face
